# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone gets CRLF and the golden bundle test compares
# markdown the pipeline generated with \n against a fixture read back with
# \r\n. That failure looks like a rendering regression and is not one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are byte-compared, so nothing here may ever be rewritten.
fixtures/** -text
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.wav binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
